    <!--Privacy Policy dialog    -->
    <string name="dialog_privacy_info">Everything you enter stays on your device, including your parties, their characters and round counters, unless you use Table sync.\n\n<b>Table sync</b>\nOnly when you start or join a session, the app signs in to Google Firebase with an anonymous ID (no name, email or account). A player\'s character (name, initiative, hp, AC, saves, maneuvers, skills, attack routine and notes) is sent to Firebase so the GM\'s app can receive it. The GM\'s app stores its copy of that character\'s hp and conditions there too, so the player can sync them; a player only sees their own character. Sessions and the characters sent to them are deleted when the GM stops the session, or at the latest about 31 days after the GM last used it. Firebase App Check is used to block requests that don\'t come from this app.\n\n<b>Ads</b>\nThe free version shows ads from Google AdMob. Google may use information such as your device\'s advertising ID to show and measure ads. If you are in the EEA or the UK, you choose whether ads may be personalised, and you can change that later under Privacy Settings.\n\n<b>Remove Ads</b>\nIf you buy Remove Ads, the app stops loading ads altogether.\n\n<b>Purchases</b>\nTips, Remove Ads and party packs are handled by Google Play. The app only learns that a purchase was made.\n\nThe full policy is on the website.</string>
    <string name="dialog_privacy_info_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="dialog_privacy_ok">Go to website</string>

